      <p>3.1 <strong>Fees.</strong> Customers agree to pay the fees for the specified services set forth in the applicable signed Order Form(s).</p>
      <p>3.2 <strong>Invoicing.</strong> Invoices will be sent each month via email; you will pay the Fees due within thirty (30) days of the date of the invoice. If you fail to pay, 360 degree may assess a late fee of 1.5% per month and suspend provision of the Services until the Fees due are paid in full.</p>
