      <p>DISCLAIMER. WITHOUT LIMITING A PARTY'S EXPRESS WARRANTIES AND OBLIGATIONS HEREUNDER, THE SERVICES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS," AND NEITHER PARTY MAKES ANY WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS, IMPLIED, STATUTORY, OR OTHERWISE.</p>

