      <p>You are solely responsible for securing your systems. 360 Degree Cloud does not access or store your data. We are not responsible for any security breaches or associated costs/fraudulent activities in your systems.</p>
    </div><!-- /tab5 -->

    <!-- TAB 6: Local Timezone Finder -->
