    <!-- TAB 9: Email Unsubscribe/Opt-Out -->
    <div id="tab9" class="tab-content">
      <h2>EMAIL UNSUBSCRIBE/OPT-OUT SERVICE LEVEL AGREEMENT</h2>
      <p>This Service Level Agreement (SLA) is made between 360 Degree Cloud ("Provider," "We," or "Us") and ("Customer", Client or "You") for the provision of Email Unsubscribe/Opt Out service, as outlined below.</p>
      <h3>1. Definition</h3>
      <p>"Email Unsubscribe/Opt-Out Service" refers to the integrated solution within Salesforce that enables efficient management, tracking, and processing of unsubscribe or opt-out requests from recipients of email communications, ensuring compliance with relevant laws such as CAN-SPAM Act, GDPR, and other email marketing standards.</p>
      <h3>2. Scope of Service</h3>
      <p>2.1 The Service provides an easy, single-click option for recipients to opt-out from email communications.</p>
      <p>2.2 Customers can personalize the unsubscribe page with your brand's logo, colors, and design elements.</p>
      <p>2.3 The Service allows the customer to capture reasons why recipients opt out of your email campaigns.</p>
      <p>2.4 The Service includes an analytical dashboard where the Customer can monitor unsubscribe rates and gain insights to refine future email campaigns.</p>
      <h3>3. Customer Responsibilities</h3>
      <p>3.1 Customer shall ensure that all information provided in connection with the Service is accurate, current, and complete.</p>
      <p>3.2 Customers agree to use the Service in compliance with all applicable laws, including data protection and privacy laws.</p>
      <p>3.3 Customer will use the Service only to process legitimate opt-out requests and will not use the Service for any illegal or unethical purposes.</p>
    </div><!-- /tab9 -->

    <!-- TAB 10: WhatSync -->
    <div id="tab10" class="tab-content">
      <h2>WHATSSYNC SERVICE LEVEL AGREEMENT</h2>
      <div class="sla-text" lang="en-GB">
        <p>This Service Level Agreement (SLA) is made between 360 Degree Cloud ("Provider," "We," or "Us") and ("Customer", Client or "You") for the provision of WhatsApp Personal Sync Services, as outlined below.</p>
        <h3>1. Definition</h3>
        <p><strong>"WhatsApp Personal Sync Service"</strong> enables users to synchronize and integrate conversations, media files, and data from their standard individual WhatsApp accounts with external systems like CRM platforms (particularly Salesforce) or across multiple devices.</p>
        <p>Do not send or trigger any test messages after connecting the WhatsApp number via WhatSync. WhatsApp may identify such behaviour as system-generated or abnormal, which can lead to number restriction or permanent blocking.</p>
        <p><strong>Allowed:</strong> Only genuine, customer-initiated, or legitimate business conversations.</p>
        <h3>2. Scope of Service</h3>
        <p>2.1 Configuration of WhatsApp accounts within the Salesforce environment.</p>
        <p>2.2 The 360 Degree will charge a one-time setup fee for the integration services.</p>
        <p>2.3 Any services beyond the initial setup will be considered additional services, charged separately.</p>
        <p>2.4 The 360 degree's responsibilities do not include support or maintenance of the WhatsApp and Meta services post-integration unless separately agreed upon.</p>
        <h3>3. Service Availability</h3>
        <p>3.1 We commit to providing 99% uptime for the WhatsApp Business services, subject to third-party services and excluding planned maintenance.</p>
        <p>3.2 Scheduled maintenance will be communicated to the Client at least 48 hours in advance.</p>
        <p>3.3 In case of service downtime caused by Meta, 360 Degree shall have no liability for recovery.</p>
        <h3>4. Customer Responsibilities</h3>
        <p>4.5 <strong>WhatSync is Strictly: No Promotional or Marketing Messages.</strong> WhatSync must not be used for promotions, campaigns, offers, discounts, marketing or bulk outreach. Sending promotional or marketing content through WhatSync is a major policy violation and may result in immediate WhatsApp number suspension.</p>
        <p>4.7 <strong>No Automation or Bulk Messaging:</strong> WhatSync should not be connected to automated workflows that trigger messages without manual control.</p>
        <h3>5. WhatsSync Compliance</h3>
        <p>5.1 Our Service is not affiliated with, authorized by, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with WhatsApp Inc. or any of its subsidiaries or affiliates.</p>
        <p>5.2 The use of our Service must comply with WhatsApp's Terms of Service.</p>
        <p>5.4 If an end customer blocks the WhatsApp number or reports the conversation, WhatsApp may restrict the number, temporarily suspend access, or permanently ban the number.</p>
        <h4><strong>Unavoidable Legal Stuff</strong></h4>
        <p>THE SERVICE AND ANY OTHER SERVICE AND CONTENT INCLUDED ON OR OTHERWISE MADE AVAILABLE TO YOU THROUGH THE SERVICE ARE PROVIDED TO YOU ON AN AS IS OR AS AVAILABLE BASIS WITHOUT ANY REPRESENTATIONS OR WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. IN NO EVENT WILL 360 Degree Cloud/SMS APP BE LIABLE TO YOU OR ANY THIRD PARTY FOR ANY SPECIAL, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, EXEMPLARY OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OF ANY KIND ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SERVICE. OUR TOTAL LIABILITY FOR ALL CAUSES OF ACTION AND UNDER ALL THEORIES OF LIABILITY WILL BE LIMITED TO THE AMOUNT YOU PAID TO 360 Degree Cloud.</p>
      </div>
    </div><!-- /tab10 -->

