    <!-- TAB 13: SMS Service -->
    <div id="tab13" class="tab-content">
      <h2>SMS SERVICE LEVEL AGREEMENT</h2>
      <p>This Service Level Agreement (SLA) is made between 360 Degree Cloud ("Provider," "We," or "Us") and ("Customer", "Client" or "You") for the provision of SMS Services, as outlined below.</p>
      <h3>1. Definition</h3>
      <p>"SMS Messaging Service" means the service for transforming, formatting and delivering an SMS Message from the Gateway to the relevant mobile GSM network.</p>
      <p>"Credits" means the currency the customer needs to purchase to send messages.</p>
      <h3>2. SMS Services</h3>
      <p>2.1 SMS service enables integration with CRM data and enables users to send messages from the CRM to the user's contacts, leads, accounts and other object records.</p>
      <p>2.2 360 Degree Cloud shall make all reasonable endeavours to ensure uninterrupted and continued use of the SMS Services; however, delivery of messages is largely dependent on the effective functioning of Network Operators' communications networks.</p>
      <h3>3. Payment and Usage of Credit Terms</h3>
      <p><strong>Credit Validity &amp; Usage:</strong> Purchased credits do not expire. All purchases shall be final, and no refunds will be issued for unused credits.</p>
      <p><strong>Late Payment Charges:</strong> Delayed payments shall accrue interest at the rate of one per cent (1%) per month, compounded half-yearly.</p>
      <p><strong>Dispute Resolution:</strong> Any dispute relating to billing must be communicated in writing within forty-five (45) days from the date of the invoice.</p>
      <p><strong>Credit Deduction Policy:</strong> 1 SMS credit per SMS up to 160 English characters (1 segment). Unicode (non-English) messages: 70 characters per credit. Messages over 160 characters are treated as long messages, with 1 credit deducted for every 153 characters.</p>
      <p>360 Degree Cloud shall levy a <strong>10% administrative markup on all carrier charges</strong> as an admin fee for reporting and operational support.</p>
      <h3>Security &amp; Liability Disclaimer</h3>
      <p>You are solely responsible for securing your systems. 360 Degree Cloud does not access or store your data. We are not responsible for any security breaches or associated costs/fraudulent activities in your systems.</p>
    </div><!-- /tab13 -->

