    <!-- TAB 15: Smart Docs -->
    <div id="tab15" class="tab-content">
      <h2>SMART DOCS SERVICE LEVEL AGREEMENT</h2>
      <div class="smart-doc-terms">
        <p><strong>ACCEPTANCE:</strong> By installing, activating, or using any product in the SMART DOC suite — including the Smart Doc Tool Salesforce package, MS Word Extension, or File Sync add-on — you confirm that you have read and agree to be legally bound by these Terms.</p>
        <p><strong>IMPORTANT — PLEASE READ CAREFULLY:</strong> These Terms govern all products under the SMART DOC suite. BY USING THE SERVICE IN ANY MANNER, YOU CONFIRM THAT YOU HAVE READ, UNDERSTOOD, AND AGREE TO BE LEGALLY BOUND BY THESE TERMS.</p>
        <p><strong>PART A — SMART DOC TOOL</strong></p>
        <p><strong>1. About Smart Doc Tool.</strong> Smart Doc Tool is a document generation platform developed and distributed by 360 Degree Cloud Technologies ("360DCT"). It runs natively within your Salesforce environment and integrates with Microsoft Office via a companion extension.</p>
        <p><strong>2. Setup &amp; Usage Workflow.</strong> Smart Doc Tool requires setup steps that are entirely the Customer's responsibility: installing the managed package, installing the MS Word Extension, completing Salesforce configuration, creating document templates, and triggering document generation.</p>
        <p><strong>3. License Grant.</strong> 360DCT grants you a non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, limited license to install and use Smart Doc Tool solely within your own licensed Salesforce organisation. The Software is licensed, not sold.</p>
